Description: An implementation-first browser workspace for defining stream
    studies and preparing terrain for FluvialGeomorph analysis. Provides a
    modular Shiny interface to shared fluvgeo capabilities for local study
    hierarchy, source terrain acquisition, analysis references, Stream DEMs,
    hydro modification, synthetic stream extraction, Flowlines, and Flowline
    Points. Includes analyst guidance and developer documentation for tracing
    implementation and evidence.
